  "Id": 2641,
  "Title": "AKU-ISMC Alumni Release Meditation Album",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "Available Now",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<p>ISMC alumni Tehmina Mansoor and Zohaib Zuby have launched their second album of guided meditations. <em>Bekhudi Chakra Activation and Healing Meditations - 7 Day Program.</em>  The duo set up their business; <a href=\"https://be-khudi.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Be-khudi </a>which offers guided meditations and inspirational content after graduating from AKU-ISMC.   The new album offers a fusion of South Asian, Chakra System and some contemporary practices of Mindfulness with some inspiration from Sufi thoughts. The duo also look to Indian Classical Music and collaborated with Coke Studio artist, Wajiha Naqvi. <br/></p>",
